<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Linxira OS — 面向科学计算的 Arch Linux 发行版</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/assets/favicon.svg">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Noto Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; background: #0E1417; color: #e5e7eb; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: hidden; }

    nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      padding: 1rem 2rem; background: rgba(14,20,23,0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.3);
    }
    .nav-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-logo img { width: 32px; height: 32px; }
    .nav-logo span { color: #e2e8f0; font-weight: 600; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .nav-links a { color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: #20B8B0; }
    .lang-link { background: rgba(51,65,85,0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); color: #e2e8f0; padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; }
    .lang-link:hover { background: rgba(32,184,176,0.2); }

    .hero { position: relative; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; padding: 8rem 2rem 5rem; overflow: hidden; }
    .hero::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -40%; left: -20%; width: 80vw; height: 80vw; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(32,184,176,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%); animation: drift 20s ease-in-out infinite alternate; pointer-events: none; }
    .hero::after { content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: -30%; right: -15%; width: 70vw; height: 70vw; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(243,111,93,0.10) 0%, transparent 70%); animation: drift 25s ease-in-out infinite alternate-reverse; pointer-events: none; }
    @keyframes drift { 0% { transform: translate(0,0) scale(1); } 100% { transform: translate(40px,-30px) scale(1.05); } }
    .grid-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(32,184,176,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(32,184,176,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 60px 60px; pointer-events: none; }
    .prism-deco { position: absolute; width: 0; height: 0; border-left: 80px solid transparent; border-right: 80px solid transparent; border-bottom: 140px solid rgba(32,184,176,0.06); top: 15%; left: 8%; transform: rotate(15deg); pointer-events: none; }
    .prism-deco-2 { position: absolute; width: 0; height: 0; border-left: 60px solid transparent; border-right: 60px solid transparent; border-bottom: 100px solid rgba(243,111,93,0.05); bottom: 20%; right: 10%; transform: rotate(-20deg); pointer-events: none; }
    .beam { position: absolute; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(32,184,176,0.15), rgba(243,111,93,0.15), transparent); pointer-events: none; }
    .beam-1 { top: 30%; left: 0; width: 100%; transform: rotate(-5deg); }
    .beam-2 { top: 60%; left: 0; width: 100%; transform: rotate(3deg); }
    .beam-3 { top: 45%; left: 0; width: 100%; transform: rotate(-2deg); opacity: 0.5; }

    .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 1000px; }
    .hero-logo { width: 140px; height: 140px; margin-bottom: 2rem; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 40px rgba(32,184,176,0.3)); }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 700; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #20B8B0, #E8F7F6, #F36F5D); background-size: 200% 200%; animation: gradient-shift 6s ease infinite; -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    @keyframes gradient-shift { 0%, 100% { background-position: 0% 50%; } 50% { background-position: 100% 50%; } }
    .tagline { font-size: 1.3rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
    .en-tagline { font-size: 1rem; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 2rem; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .hero-desc { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 2.5rem; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 1.02rem; }
    .hero-desc strong { color: #20B8B0; }
    .hero-ctas { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
    .cta { display: inline-block; padding: 1rem 2.5rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #20B8B0, #F36F5D); color: white; font-weight: 600; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(32,184,176,0.3); }
    .cta:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 6px 30px rgba(32,184,176,0.4); text-decoration: none; }
    .cta-ghost { display: inline-block; padding: 1rem 2rem; color: #e2e8f0; border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.8); border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; transition: all 0.2s; }
    .cta-ghost:hover { border-color: #20B8B0; color: #20B8B0; text-decoration: none; }

    .badges { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .badge { font-size: 0.8rem; background: rgba(32,184,176,0.12); color: #20B8B0; padding: 0.35rem 1rem; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid rgba(32,184,176,0.25); }
    .badge-coral { background: rgba(243,111,93,0.12); color: #F36F5D; border-color: rgba(243,111,93,0.25); }

    .section-block { padding: 5rem 0; }
    .section-block-alt { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0E1417 0%, #141a26 100%); }
    .section-block-alt2 { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0a0f1a 0%, #0E1417 100%); }
    .section { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }
    .section-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
    .section-title { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #20B8B0, #F36F5D); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; }
    .section-subtitle { color: #64748b; font-size: 1rem; }
    .section-divider { width: 60px; height: 3px; margin: 1rem auto 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #20B8B0, #F36F5D); border-radius: 2px; }

    .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.2rem; }
    .feature { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30,41,59,0.8), rgba(14,20,23,0.9)); border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.6rem; text-align: left; backdrop-filter: blur(10px); transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s; }
    .feature:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: rgba(32,184,176,0.4); }
    .feature .feature-icon { font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: 0.7rem; display: block; }
    .feature h3 { color: #20B8B0; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-size: 1.08rem; }
    .feature p { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.55; }

    .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: center; }
    .about-text h3 { color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .about-text p { color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .about-text strong { color: #20B8B0; }
    .about-stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
    .stat-card { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30,41,59,0.7), rgba(14,20,23,0.9)); border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.4rem; text-align: center; }
    .stat-num { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #20B8B0, #F36F5D); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; }
    .stat-label { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 0.3rem; }

    .ecosystem-link { display: block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30,41,59,0.8), rgba(14,20,23,0.9)); border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); border-radius: 16px; padding: 2rem; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s; }
    .ecosystem-link:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: rgba(32,184,176,0.5); }
    .ecosystem-link h3 { color: #20B8B0; font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
    .ecosystem-link p { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
    .ecosystem-tags { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .eco-tag { font-size: 0.78rem; background: rgba(32,184,176,0.1); color: #20B8B0; border: 1px solid rgba(32,184,176,0.2); padding: 0.25rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 999px; }

    .blog-section { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0a0f1a 0%, #0E1417 100%); padding: 5rem 0; }
    .blog-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
    .blog-card { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30,41,59,0.6), rgba(14,20,23,0.8)); border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.5rem; text-decoration: none; transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s; }
    .blog-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: rgba(32,184,176,0.4); }
    .blog-date { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .blog-title { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 600; color: #e2e8f0; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .blog-desc { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.5; }
    .blog-tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.7rem; background: rgba(32,184,176,0.15); color: #20B8B0; padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 0.75rem; }

    .release-section { padding: 4rem 0; }
    .release-card { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30,41,59,0.8), rgba(14,20,23,0.9)); border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); border-radius: 16px; padding: 2.5rem; text-align: center; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .release-card h3 { color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
    .release-card p { color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .release-status-line { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 1.2rem; }
    .release-item { font-size: 0.82rem; color: #94a3b8; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; }

    footer { text-align: center; padding: 3rem 2rem; color: #475569; font-size: 0.85rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.3); background: #0a0f1a; }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
      .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .about-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
      .blog-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .nav-links { gap: 1rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav>
    <a href="/zh/" class="nav-logo"><img src="/assets/linxira-l.svg" alt="Linxira"><span>Linxira OS</span></a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="/zh/docs/">文档</a>
      <a href="/zh/docs/ecosystem/">软件生态</a>
      <a href="/bio-sdk/">Bio SDK</a>
      <a href="/zh/legal/brand-assets/">品牌资产</a>
      <a href="/zh/roadmap/">路线图</a>
      <a href="/zh/blog/">博客</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/Linxira-OS" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
      <a href="/en/" class="lang-link">EN</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="grid-bg"></div>
    <div class="prism-deco"></div>
    <div class="prism-deco-2"></div>
    <div class="beam beam-1"></div>
    <div class="beam beam-2"></div>
    <div class="beam beam-3"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <img src="/assets/linxira-l.svg" alt="Linxira OS" class="hero-logo">
      <h1>Linxira OS</h1>
      <p class="tagline">为科学计算而生的 Arch Linux 桌面</p>
      <p class="en-tagline">Desktop Supercomputer · Direct Arch · 面向研究者</p>
      <p class="hero-desc">基于 <strong>Arch Linux</strong> 构建的个人科学工作站发行版——开箱即用的 <strong>KDE Plasma</strong> 桌面、<strong>93 款精选软件</strong> 的审核目录、<strong>双内核 + 快照</strong> 的滚动更新安全网，以及 <strong>容器化复现</strong> 的科研工作流。面向理科生与开发者，既是一台可以日常使用的电脑，也是一台随时候命的计算设备。</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="/zh/docs/" class="cta">开始使用</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/ecosystem/" class="cta-ghost">浏览软件生态 →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="badges">
        <span class="badge">测试版 ISO 已通过完整安装测试</span>
        <span class="badge">签名软件仓库 [linxira]</span>
        <span class="badge badge-coral">2026.09 正式发布</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 核心特性 -->
  <section class="section-block section-block-alt">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">为什么选择 Linxira</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">一个发行版把「日常桌面」和「科学计算」都做好</p>
        <div class="section-divider"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="features">
        <div class="feature"><span class="feature-icon">🖥️</span><h3>Direct Arch 桌面</h3><p>KDE Plasma 桌面直接基于 Arch 官方仓库构建，软件最新、性能最优。双内核（linux + linux-lts）作为滚动更新的兜底。</p></div>
        <div class="feature"><span class="feature-icon">📦</span><h3>93 款审核软件目录</h3><p>内置经过审核的软件目录：容器、开发工具、科研应用、AI 工具……安装器里勾选即装，无需自己翻仓库。</p></div>
        <div class="feature"><span class="feature-icon">🔐</span><h3>签名仓库 [linxira]</h3><p>17 个自研工具全部通过自有签名密钥发布，pacman 可直接追踪更新——从 Welcome 到 Config Hub，一条链路管到底。</p></div>
        <div class="feature"><span class="feature-icon">🛡️</span><h3>滚动更新安全网</h3><p>Timeshift 自动快照 + grub-btrfs 开机回滚 + 双内核切换，滚挂的代价从「重装」降为「重启选一下」。</p></div>
        <div class="feature"><span class="feature-icon">🐳</span><h3>容器化科研复现</h3><p>Podman、Distrobox、Apptainer 开箱即用——拉取别人的环境、复现实验结果、发布自己的镜像，无损且低开销。</p></div>
        <div class="feature"><span class="feature-icon">⚡</span><h3>无头模式</h3><p>需要算力时一条命令切到命令行模式，桌面零占用、内存全给计算；用完随时回到桌面。你的电脑就是小型超算。</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 定位介绍 -->
  <section class="section-block">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-text">
          <h3>为谁而建</h3>
          <p>Linxira 面向 <strong>理科生、研究人员与开发者</strong>：需要一台日常好用的电脑，也需要它随时变成计算设备。</p>
          <p>很多发行版要么偏重桌面体验、要么偏重服务器能力，两者难以兼得。Linxira 的思路是：<strong>桌面完整保留</strong>（蓝牙 / WiFi / 打印 / 图形界面全部开箱即用），同时提供 <strong>内存优化、无头模式、容器复现</strong> 这些科研刚需——它不是「迷你服务器」，而是「随时能进计算模式的桌面超算」。</p>
          <p>更重要的是，<strong>安装无需网络</strong>：ISO 内置完整离线包源，无网也能装出可用的完整系统——这对校园网、内网环境尤其重要。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-stats">
          <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num">93</div><div class="stat-label">审核软件</div></div>
          <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num">17</div><div class="stat-label">自研工具</div></div>
          <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num">804</div><div class="stat-label">离线包</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 软件生态 -->
  <section class="section-block section-block-alt2">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">软件生态</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">审核目录覆盖日常与科研的每一个环节</p>
        <div class="section-divider"></div>
      </div>
      <a href="/zh/docs/ecosystem/" class="ecosystem-link">
        <h3>浏览完整软件目录 →</h3>
        <p>93 款精选软件，14 个分类：从浏览器办公到生信分析，从容器复现到 AI 编码</p>
        <div class="ecosystem-tags">
          <span class="eco-tag">容器</span><span class="eco-tag">开发工具</span><span class="eco-tag">生信工作流</span><span class="eco-tag">科学计算</span><span class="eco-tag">AI 编码</span><span class="eco-tag">办公</span><span class="eco-tag">游戏</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 发布状态 -->
  <section class="release-section">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="release-card">
        <h3>发布状态</h3>
        <p>第一个测试版 ISO（2026.08）已通过完整安装测试：自研软件全部可正常安装、启动 / 关机标识与终端字符画已定稿、签名仓库可追踪更新。</p>
        <a href="/zh/roadmap/" class="cta-ghost" style="padding:0.8rem 1.8rem;">查看发布路线图 →</a>
        <div class="release-status-line">
          <span class="release-item">✅ 测试版安装验证通过</span>
          <span class="release-item">🔧 完整版构建中（2026.09）</span>
          <span class="release-item">📦 ISO 将于公开发布时放出</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Blog -->
  <section class="blog-section">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">最新动态</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">项目公告和技术文章</p>
        <div class="section-divider"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="blog-grid">
        <a href="/zh/blog/introducing-linxira-os/" class="blog-card">
          <div class="blog-date">2026-06-27</div>
          <div class="blog-title">Linxira OS 介绍</div>
          <div class="blog-desc">Linxira OS 是什么，为谁而建，为什么要做这个项目。设计理念、技术架构和目标用户。</div>
          <span class="blog-tag">公告</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer><p>Linxira OS 直接基于 Arch Linux 构建，是与 Arch Linux 无隶属关系且未经其官方认可的独立项目。品牌资产见 <a href="/zh/legal/brand-assets/" style="color:#64748b;">品牌资产政策</a>。</p></footer>
</body>
</html>
